Keywords and Reserved Words

JavaScript has reserved keywords with special meanings.

These cannot be used as variable names.

Examples
let
const
var
if
else
return
function
class
Wrong Example
let function = "JavaScript";

This gives an error because function is a reserved keyword.

## Identifiers in JavaScript

